{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonless Night</strong> is a 2D retro-style psychological horror and survival game, where you\u2019ll descend into the mind of Selene to uncover the sins that bind her. But she\u2019s not alone\u2014others wander this place, each carrying secrets waiting to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\u201cLight purifies sins, and flames consume sinners.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selene awakens in an unknown world with no memory of how she arrived. Her only clues are fragments of fading memories and cryptic pages that whisper of a past she cannot escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980180/extras/c81d7a4944d84b8f924dc41d6bf7b0c3.poster.avif?t=1760740461\" width=864 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980180/extras/c81d7a4944d84b8f924dc41d6bf7b0c3.webm?t=1760740461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Selene\u2019s story</strong> \u2013 Guide her through a world where her only hope of freedom lies in confronting her past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a labyrinth of shadows</strong> \u2013 A place filled with hidden truths about Selene and others trapped within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run from the darkness, seek the light</strong> \u2013 Every choice draws you closer to salvation\u2026 or damnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face your sins</strong> \u2013 The truth awaits those who dare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve  puzzles</strong> \u2013 Test your mind with challenging puzzles to unlock tools and paths to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 Your actions shape Selene\u2019s fate, leading to six different conclusions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grim and silent world awaits. There are no weapons, only fear. Hide, escape, and discover. With high replayability, every playthrough brings new possibilities, new paths, and new endings.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Virtuous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/c55ade5db2eeca78b826573230aa6f09d79ac51b.jpg"},{"name":"Photographic memory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/c020f6f1f85a06a4dd6893aee9e6be353a7d2c22.jpg"},{"name":"And there was light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/4524e4976ce53a2c9dedb8149917b966b895e555.jpg"},{"name":"Total energy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/3ad51c112cb26ed39364e7f133b85e267e839b34.jpg"},{"name":"I should have washed that","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/5779926204ec60bd720c87dc517fb0d3f9bc0891.jpg"},{"name":"Not a scratch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/fd3af9fe1543f3458832a9f84846203a08b06357.jpg"},{"name":"Dear Diary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/5aebfb400257992071e73eba5259f72f878a34ca.jpg"},{"name":"Old-fashioned player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/ec04d5de98d18d21ac1b3524996fd4b3cdf15faa.jpg"},{"name":"Ashes to ashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3980180/54a937088d5244e15a841fa76e147d4c1229ce2b.jpg"},{"name":"I just want to be at peace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.