=1760740461\" width=864 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980180/extras/c81d7a4944d84b8f924dc41d6bf7b0c3.webm?t=1760740461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Selene\u2019s story</strong> \u2013 Guide her through a world where her only hope of freedom lies in confronting her past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a labyrinth of shadows</strong> \u2013 A place filled with hidden truths about Selene and others trapped within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run from the darkness, seek the light</strong> \u2013 Every choice draws you closer to salvation\u2026 or damnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face your sins</strong> \u2013 The truth awaits those who dare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve  puzzles</strong> \u2013 Test your mind with challenging puzzles to unlock tools and paths to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 Your actions shape Selene\u2019s fate, leading to six different conclusions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grim and silent world awaits. There are no weapons, only fear. Hide, escape, and discover. With high replayability, every playthrough brings new possibilities, new paths, and new endings.</p>","developers":["Tzompixel Studio"],"dlc":[4104050],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980180/b81530d28165aeab513f85fd75bd7ab7d17aeabf/header.jpg?t=1760740461","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3980180/2143686608/1f1f33ec9767389fb